{"articleNo":"94307","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=94307&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013-2학기 복수전공 및 부전공 이수포기(변경) 신청기간 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.11.04","hit":"4890","attachments":[{"name":"복수전공 이수포기(변경) 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=94307&attachNo=3204"},{"name":"부전공 이수포기 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=94307&attachNo=3720"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000080 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000080 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000080 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000080 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"619\" height=\"47\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'\">복수전공, 부전공 이수 포기(변경) 신청 안내</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2013학년도 2학기 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">복수전공 및 부전공 이수 포기(변경)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">에 관한 사항을 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 아래와 같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">안내하오니 희망하는 학생은 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">신청 기간 : 2013.11.11.(월)～11.14.(목)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">신청 장소</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">복수전공 및 부전공 해당 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">“종합학사행정실”</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">신청원을 작성하여 소속 학부장을 경유(날인)한 후 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 복수전공(변경)/부전공 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">학부장에게 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">신청</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> 서류</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : 포기(변경)신청서 및 성적증명서 각 1부</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 178.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -178.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">4. 참고사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 복수전공을 부전공으로 변경하고자 할 때에는 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 38.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -38.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이수 성적이 평점평균 3.00이상 이어야 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복수전공 및 부전공을 포기한 경우 기 취득한 학점은 일반선택학점으로 인정하며, </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;복수전공에서 부전공으로 변경하는 경우에는 부전공학점으로 인정합니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000066; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">졸업 대상자 중에서 복수전공 및 부전공 이수자로 선발 되었으나, </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 35.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -35.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000066; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이수가 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #000066; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">불가능할 경우에는 반드시 이수 포기 신청을 하여야 합니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2013. 11. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; LETTER-SPACING: 7.2pt\">교무처장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
